Every clinician should determine a functional-benefit-evaluation with a patient for a subacute-pain before an opioid-initiation.
Every clinician should determine a functional-benefit-evaluation with a patient for a chronic-pain before an opioid-initiation.
Every clinician should establish a specific-measurable-treatment-goal with a patient for a subacute-pain before an opioid-initiation.
Every clinician should establish a specific-measurable-treatment-goal with a patient for a chronic-pain before an opioid-initiation.
